      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palmer_Lake%2C_Colorado",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Palmer Lake was a critical water stop for steam trains climbing the Palmer Divide summit before heading south to Denver.",
